Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:44:43 +1100
Subject: Add the Little Trainer simple battle menu

ATTACK / CATCH (or CHANGE against trainers) / SPECIAL / RUN replace the
action menu, move list and bag for the Little Trainer preset. ATTACK and
SPECIAL pick suitable moves automatically (a Pokemon with no attacks borrows
Tackle for the battle only), CATCH throws a Poke Ball without touching the
bag, B does nothing, and running from wild Pokemon always succeeds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

